{"description": "The most comprehensive universal, multilingual, and monolingual dictionaries—perfect for e-readers, phones, tablets, and desktop apps. Powered by Wiktionary.", "homepage": "https://www.reader-dict.com", "topics": ["dictionary", "dict", "python", "kobo", "ebook-reader", "stardict", "plato", "kindle", "kindlegen", "goldendict", "wiktionary-dump", "wiktionary-parser", "wiktionary", "koreader", "bilingual"], "pushed_at": "2026-11-12T07:59:19Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-11T07:23:08Z", "detail": {"avatar": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219702879?v=4", "license": "MIT", "discussions_total": 28, "latest_release": {"name": "Lithuanian", "tag": "lt", "published_at": "2026-01-15T20:59:04Z", "body": "Up-to-date files are now available on [reader.dict](https://www.reader-dict.com/en/download/lt) (and they are still free).\r\n\r\n", "is_prerelease": false}, "hot_issues": [{"number": 2581, "title": "🆕 Open Dictionary support", "comments": 4, "created_at": "2025-10-24T09:52:07Z"}, {"number": 2635, "title": "🆕 Tolino support", "comments": 0, "created_at": "2026-02-11T12:45:29Z"}], "discussions": [{"number": 2796, "title": "🧑‍🍳 New language: Basque (Update 2026-11-01)", "comments": 0, "category": "Announcements", "created_at": "2026-11-01T14:24:58Z"}, {"number": 2791, "title": "Free Spanish dictionary for PocketBook built on reader.dict", "comments": 2, "category": "Show and tell", "created_at": "2026-10-18T17:20:13Z"}, {"number": 2785, "title": "Word Lookup website + Bulgarian (Update 2026-10-01)", "comments": 0, "category": "Announcements", "created_at": "2026-10-03T11:27:14Z"}, {"number": 2783, "title": "How to install on Meebook?", "comments": 1, "category": "Q&A", "created_at": "2026-09-30T04:36:28Z"}, {"number": 2778, "title": "How to install on Vivlio One?", "comments": 1, "category": "Q&A", "created_at": "2026-09-17T18:16:33Z"}, {"number": 2766, "title": "New languages: Finnish, Latin, Malagasy + Vivlio One + Bitcoin payments (Update 2026-09-01)", "comments": 0, "category": "Announcements", "created_at": "2026-09-03T07:39:39Z"}, {"number": 2740, "title": "New languages: Czech, Korean, Lojban, Thai, and Ukranian (Update 2026-09-01)", "comments": 0, "category": "Announcements", "created_at": "2026-08-04T21:32:36Z"}, {"number": 2737, "title": "Rendering of etymology tree", "comments": 1, "category": "Q&A", "created_at": "2026-07-27T04:55:54Z"}], "readme": "# reader.dict Monolingual Dictionaries\n\n![reader.dict logo](https://github.com/reader-dict/.github/raw/refs/heads/main/profile/header-logo.svg)\n\n🚀 Features, **downloads**, and installation details on [reader.dict](https://www.reader-dict.com).\n\n🎇 Want to know what is being cooked, and what was done in past releases? Have a look at our [discussions](https://github.com/reader-dict/monolingual/discussions).\n\n---\n\n## Development\n\nSet up a virtual environment:\n\n```bash\npython3.13 -m venv venv\n\n# For Linux and Mac users\n. venv/bin/activate\n\n# For Windows users\n. venv/Scripts/activate\n```\n\nInstall, or update, dependencies:\n\n```bash\npython -m pip install -U pip\npython -m pip install -r requirements-tests.txt\n```\n\nRun tests:\n\n```bash\n# All tests, must be run in two steps to prevent database issues\npython -m pytest --doctest-modules wikidict\npython -m pytest tests\n\n# Skip those requiring a working internet connection\npython -m pytest tests -m \"not webtest\"\n```\n\nRun linters, and quality checkers, before submitting a pull-request:\n\n```bash\n./check.sh\n```\n\n## Contributors 💖\n\n[![All Contributors](https://img.shields.io/github/all-contributors/reader-dict/monolingual?color=ee8449&style=flat-square)](#contributors)\n\nThanks go to these wonderful people ([emoji key](https://allcontributors.org/docs/en/emoji-key)):\n\n<!-- ALL-CONTRIBUTORS-LIST:START - Do not remove or modify this section -->\n<!-- prettier-ignore-start -->\n<!-- markdownlint-disable -->\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" w